arm64: dts: qcom: qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a: adapt PIL firmware paths

Radxa 在 radxa-pkg/radxa-firmware 中分发的 ADSP/CDSP 固件为单文件
.mbn (Qualcomm ELF) 格式，路径在 qcom/qcs6490/radxa/dragon-q6a/ 下；
而非 mainline DT 期望的 qcom/qcs6490/{adsp,cdsp}.mdt + .b0X split。

qcom mdt_loader 的 qcom_mdt_bins_are_split() 会通过 ELF program
header 的 p_offset / p_filesz 自动判断 split vs 单文件，把 firmware
-name 指向 .mbn 即可直接 load，无需提供 .b0X。

同时关闭 IPA 与 mpss：
 - Q6A 板无 modem，IPA 无通路用不到，且 boot 时请求 ipa_fws.mdt
   失败会触发 ioremap WARNING（reserved-mem 冲突）；
 - mpss DT 节点的 reserved-mem (246 MiB @ 0x8b800000) 与其他段
   冲突，qcom_q6v5_pas probe 时已经因 "unable to map memory region"
   失败 (-16)；显式 disable 让 cycle warning 也消失。

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
index 3af8328a0..4c40ed39e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
@@ -646,18 +646,17 @@ &qupv3_id_1 {
 };
 
 &remoteproc_adsp {
-	firmware-name = "qcom/qcs6490/adsp.mdt";
+	firmware-name = "qcom/qcs6490/radxa/dragon-q6a/adsp.mbn";
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &remoteproc_cdsp {
-	firmware-name = "qcom/qcs6490/cdsp.mdt";
+	firmware-name = "qcom/qcs6490/radxa/dragon-q6a/cdsp.mbn";
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &remoteproc_mpss {
-	firmware-name = "qcom/qcs6490/modem.mdt";
-	status = "okay";
+	status = "disabled";
 };
 
 &remoteproc_wpss {
@@ -665,6 +664,10 @@ &remoteproc_wpss {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&ipa {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
 &uart5 {
 	compatible = "qcom,geni-debug-uart";
 	status = "okay";
